{#-
  A README for a project that does not have one.

  It will almost never be written: any repository with a hand-written README is
  `Foreign`, and `--force` does not move that (ADR-0007 §4). So this template is
  for the genuinely blank case — a directory `vibe scan` found that has no prose
  at all — and it is written as a *starting point a person will edit*, not as a
  finished document pretending to be one.

  That is why it says less than CLAUDE.md rather than more. A generated README
  that looks complete is worse than a short one, because nobody rewrites a file
  that looks finished.
-#}
